  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large bowl, combine flour, cold butter, and brown sugar. Mix until crumbly.",
    "Add prunes, eggs, and milk to the bowl. Mix until a dough forms.",
    "Roll out dough on a floured surface to a thickness of 1/4 inch.",
    "Transfer dough to a 9-inch pie dish. Trim edges and crimp.",
    "Bake for 25-30 minutes or until crust is golden brown.",
    "Let cool for 10 minutes before serving."
